> 
> Question? Do rings run down of there own accord, or was the failure
> due specifically to my fainting state? Will all rings fail if one
> is fainting?
> 

   Rings eat food too.  When your food supply ran out so did your ring's.
   A quick way to realize this is teleporting w/ Ring of Teleport Control.
   You can move about the level "as the crow flies" but you use the same
   amount of food as if you had walked the same distance plus the food your
   rings ate.  Two rings use quite a bit of food.  Good policy is to keep
   unnecessary rings off your fingers until you need to use them.

